# Which Chromium profile a clicked link opens in.
#
#   <host pattern>   <profile>
#
# Profiles are Chromium DISPLAY NAMES ("WattCarbon", "Personal" -- one word
# each, since the columns are whitespace-separated). chromium-profile looks the
# directory up in "Local State", so these work unchanged on every machine. A
# profile this machine doesn't have (WattCarbon on a personal box) just doesn't
# route: the link opens in whatever profile was last used.
#
# Patterns match the URL HOST only, in two forms:
#   example.com      exact host
#   *.example.com    example.com and any subdomain of it
#   *                everything (the fallback)
#
# FIRST MATCH WINS, so specific rules must sit above general ones. Add a work
# tool here the first time it opens in the wrong profile; no restart needed.

# --- WattCarbon -----------------------------------------------------------
wattcarbon.com          WattCarbon
*.wattcarbon.com        WattCarbon
wattcarbon.dev          WattCarbon
*.wattcarbon.dev        WattCarbon

# --- AWS ------------------------------------------------------------------
# Scoped to aws.amazon.com, NOT amazon.com, so shopping stays personal.
# *.aws.amazon.com covers regional consoles (us-west-2.console.aws.amazon.com).
aws.amazon.com          WattCarbon
*.aws.amazon.com        WattCarbon
amazonaws.com           WattCarbon
*.amazonaws.com         WattCarbon
*.aws                   WattCarbon

# --- Sentry ---------------------------------------------------------------
sentry.io               WattCarbon
*.sentry.io             WattCarbon

# --- Slack ----------------------------------------------------------------
slack.com               WattCarbon
*.slack.com             WattCarbon

# --- GitHub ---------------------------------------------------------------
github.com              WattCarbon
*.github.com            WattCarbon
githubusercontent.com   WattCarbon
*.githubusercontent.com WattCarbon

# --- Linear ---------------------------------------------------------------
linear.app              WattCarbon
*.linear.app            WattCarbon

# --- Linkedin -------------------------------------------------------------
linkedin.com            WattCarbon

# --- Explicitly personal --------------------------------------------------
# Redundant with the fallback today, but keeps the intent on record and stays
# correct if a broad work rule is ever added above.
youtube.com             Personal
*.youtube.com           Personal
youtu.be                Personal

# --- Fallback -------------------------------------------------------------
*                       Personal
